  "notes": [
    "Fields are documented by the supplied v4.0.4 protocol; authenticated document fixtures are still needed to confirm operation-specific shape and optionality.",
    "QUANTITY_EXT optionality is inconsistent in the source protocol. Verify before external writes.",
    "Preserve source VAT classification; it is not a retail tax percentage.",
    "Missing or ambiguous goods IDs require review; never substitute barcode for line identity.",
    "UNIT_TXT is required for UNIT_ID=99 in the save protocol.",
    "BAR_CODE represents a medicine registration number when IS_MED=1; it is not necessarily a scanner barcode.",
    "IS_CONFIRMED uses 0 unconfirmed, 1 confirmed, -1 rejected; unknown values require review.",
    "The PDF contains malformed sample tags. Do not copy sample XML verbatim.",
    "The get_waybills_v1 result schema is not fully enumerated; do not invent a LAST_UPDATE_DATE field."
  ],
